  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Official-level Inward Visit to UK: Iraq&#x2019;s Energy Transition Experts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy transition is critical for Iraq&#x2019;s economic sustainability, environment, energy security and energy access. This two-day visit would enable wide-ranging discussions with key stakeholders in London. This visit will help HMG to understand Iraqi priorities, planning and timeframe for energy transition. We will outline the UK&#x2019;s approach to energy transition, including policy framework, regulation, decarbonisation of production, reducing gas flaring and utilising clean technologies. We will explore opportunities for UK support, including through UK expertise and technical assistance, sharing best practice, and leveraging UK&#x2019;s convening power. This visit will allow us to understand challenges to accelerating energy transition in Iraq and explore UK experience in navigating similar challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
